abstract: >-
  Membrane-arena 3x3 with Crystallize injection under the bubble split:
  the engine is vendored unchanged inside, an external observer records
  REPORTED run and probe outcomes without mutating the system, and an
  external calibrator updates an assumed model only or refuses with a
  FailureCapsule. Mun Seok Lee is cited as inspiration only for the
  Digital to Wave paradigm.
